      "updated": 1792742834136,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Code layout (pnpm workspace)\nbackend/ — Hono Worker, one folder per module\ncontroller (HTTP) → service → repository\n(Drizzle) + dto (Zod)\nsend-email · templates · smtp-config\napi-keys · email-logs · dashboard\nidempotency · queue · workflows\ntransports · core · middleware\ndeps wired by hand in src/index.ts\nfrontend/ — Astro + React (shadcn/ui)",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-p-code",
      "originalText": "Code layout (pnpm workspace)\nbackend/ — Hono Worker, one folder per module\ncontroller (HTTP) → service → repository\n(Drizzle) + dto (Zod)\nsend-email · templates · smtp-config\napi-keys · email-logs · dashboard\nidempotency · queue · workflows\ntransports · core · middleware\ndeps wired by hand in src/index.ts\nfrontend/ — Astro + React (shadcn/ui)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
