      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Delivery — GitHub Actions only\nCI on PRs and pushes to main / dev:\nlint · tsc · Vitest · frontend build\nPull request → preview Worker\nmakisend-poc-preview, fresh D1,\n-preview queues and workflow\nPush → remote D1 migrations,\nthen wrangler deploy (production)\nNothing is deployed from a laptop",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ar-p-cicd",
      "originalText": "Delivery — GitHub Actions only\nCI on PRs and pushes to main / dev:\nlint · tsc · Vitest · frontend build\nPull request → preview Worker\nmakisend-poc-preview, fresh D1,\n-preview queues and workflow\nPush → remote D1 migrations,\nthen wrangler deploy (production)\nNothing is deployed from a laptop",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
