      "text": "Known limits\nAt least once: if D1 fails right after\nthe SMTP send, a duplicate is possible\nOne AES key, no rotation: changing it\nmakes stored data unreadable\nNo bounce, open or click tracking\nSPF / DKIM / DMARC: configured at the\nSMTP provider, not in the code\nOne SMTP provider per config, no failover",
